  "aspects": {
    "sun_conjunction_moon": "<b>Sun Conjunction Moon:</b> Your core identity and vital energy merges powerfully with your emotional needs and unconscious responses. This creates a fused, intense dynamic where these two areas of your life cannot operate independently.",
    "sun_sextile_moon": "<b>Sun Sextile Moon:</b> Your core identity and vital energy harmonizes with your emotional needs and unconscious responses. This creates a supportive flow that encourages these two areas of your life.",
    "sun_square_moon": "<b>Sun Square Moon:</b> Your core identity and vital energy creates tension and friction with your emotional needs and unconscious responses. This creates a challenging but highly motivating dynamic that demands action and resolution between these two areas of your life.",
    "sun_trine_moon": "<b>Sun Trine Moon:</b> Your core identity and vital energy flows effortlessly with your emotional needs and unconscious responses. This creates a natural talent and ease between these two areas of your life, though it can sometimes lead to complacency.",
    "sun_opposition_moon": "<b>Sun Opposition Moon:</b> Your core identity and vital energy is polarized against your emotional needs and unconscious responses. This creates a tug-of-war dynamic where you must learn to balance and integrate these two competing areas of your life.",
    "sun_quincunx_moon": "<b>Sun Quincunx Moon:</b> Your core identity and vital energy is awkwardly misaligned with your emotional needs and unconscious responses. This creates a need for constant adjustment and compromise between these two areas of your life.",
