    "saturn_quincunx_uranus": "<b>Saturn Quincunx Uranus:</b> Your sense of discipline, restriction, and maturity is awkwardly misaligned with your urge for rebellion, innovation, and freedom. This creates a need for constant adjustment and compromise between these two areas of your life.",
    "saturn_conjunction_neptune": "<b>Saturn Conjunction Neptune:</b> Your sense of discipline, restriction, and maturity merges powerfully with your dreams, illusions, and spiritual empathy. This creates a fused, intense dynamic where these two areas of your life cannot operate independently.",
    "saturn_sextile_neptune": "<b>Saturn Sextile Neptune:</b> Your sense of discipline, restriction, and maturity harmonizes with your dreams, illusions, and spiritual empathy. This creates a supportive flow that encourages these two areas of your life.",
    "saturn_square_neptune": "<b>Saturn Square Neptune:</b> Your sense of discipline, restriction, and maturity creates tension and friction with your dreams, illusions, and spiritual empathy. This creates a challenging but highly motivating dynamic that demands action and resolution between these two areas of your life.",
    "saturn_trine_neptune": "<b>Saturn Trine Neptune:</b> Your sense of discipline, restriction, and maturity flows effortlessly with your dreams, illusions, and spiritual empathy. This creates a natural talent and ease between these two areas of your life, though it can sometimes lead to complacency.",
