    "saturn_conjunction_lilith": "<b>Saturn Conjunction Black Moon Lilith:</b> Your sense of discipline, restriction, and maturity merges powerfully with your raw, untamed nature and shadow desires. This creates a fused, intense dynamic where these two areas of your life cannot operate independently.",
    "saturn_sextile_lilith": "<b>Saturn Sextile Black Moon Lilith:</b> Your sense of discipline, restriction, and maturity harmonizes with your raw, untamed nature and shadow desires. This creates a supportive flow that encourages these two areas of your life.",
    "saturn_square_lilith": "<b>Saturn Square Black Moon Lilith:</b> Your sense of discipline, restriction, and maturity creates tension and friction with your raw, untamed nature and shadow desires. This creates a challenging but highly motivating dynamic that demands action and resolution between these two areas of your life.",
    "saturn_trine_lilith": "<b>Saturn Trine Black Moon Lilith:</b> Your sense of discipline, restriction, and maturity flows effortlessly with your raw, untamed nature and shadow desires. This creates a natural talent and ease between these two areas of your life, though it can sometimes lead to complacency.",
    "saturn_opposition_lilith": "<b>Saturn Opposition Black Moon Lilith:</b> Your sense of discipline, restriction, and maturity is polarized against your raw, untamed nature and shadow desires. This creates a tug-of-war dynamic where you must learn to balance and integrate these two competing areas of your life.",
    "saturn_quincunx_lilith": "<b>Saturn Quincunx Black Moon Lilith:</b> Your sense of discipline, restriction, and maturity is awkwardly misaligned with your raw, untamed nature and shadow desires. This creates a need for constant adjustment and compromise between these two areas of your life.",
    "uranus_conjunction_sun": "<b>This aspect fuses the core identity with an electric, disruptive energy, creating a highly individualized and rebellious character.</b><br><br>The ego is inextricably linked to being a catalyst for change, often leading to a life marked by sudden shifts and a profound rejection of conformity.",
    "uranus_sextile_sun": "<b>The individual effortlessly integrates their unique eccentricities with their core identity, naturally shining as a progressive and open-minded leader.</b><br><br>This aspect grants a natural talent for innovation, allowing them to implement new ideas without alienating others.",
    "uranus_square_sun": "<b>There is a perpetual, tense friction between the desire for ego stability and a compulsive need to rebel against authority.</b><br><br>This individual often experiences sudden, self-imposed life upheavals as they continuously fight to assert their independence and authentic selfhood.",
    "uranus_trine_sun": "<b>This highly favorable aspect allows the individual's creative brilliance and innovative spirit to flow smoothly into their life's purpose.</b><br><br>They are naturally magnetic and uniquely themselves, effortlessly attracting opportunities through their authentic, forward-thinking approach.",
    "uranus_opposition_sun": "<b>The individual frequently projects their own erratic, rebellious nature onto others, often clashing with authority figures or attracting disruptive partners.</b><br><br>Psychologically, they must learn to own their innate need for radical freedom rather than experiencing it as external shocks or interpersonal conflict.",
    "uranus_quincunx_sun": "<b>This aspect creates a persistent, awkward adjustment between the ego's basic expression and sudden, unpredictable flashes of change.</b><br><br>The individual often feels they must unexpectedly alter their core life path to accommodate disruptive events they cannot control.",
    "uranus_conjunction_moon": "<b>Emotional responses are lightning-fast, highly volatile, and deeply unconventional.</b><br><br>The individual requires profound emotional freedom and often experiences sudden intuitive flashes, though they may struggle with a restless, easily overstimulated nervous system.",
    "uranus_sextile_moon": "<b>The individual possesses a healthy emotional detachment that allows them to process feelings with brilliant objectivity.</b><br><br>They easily find comfort in alternative lifestyles, progressive communities, and non-traditional domestic arrangements.",
    "uranus_square_moon": "<b>Inner emotional security is constantly at odds with a craving for absolute independence, leading to sudden emotional outbursts or sudden severing of intimate ties.</b><br><br>Psychologically, they must heal the inner turbulence that equates emotional closeness with a suffocating loss of freedom.",
    "uranus_trine_moon": "<b>This harmonious flow integrates emotional needs with a love for the unconventional, fostering a highly intuitive and adaptable nature.</b><br><br>The individual can gracefully navigate sudden life changes, finding emotional fulfillment through progressive ideals and liberated relationships.",
    "uranus_opposition_moon": "<b>A persistent polarity exists between the primal need for nurturing and an erratic drive to emotionally detach.</b><br><br>They may attract unstable domestic situations or emotionally unavailable partners until they balance their own inner fluctuations.",
    "uranus_quincunx_moon": "<b>The individual struggles to reconcile their emotional habits with sudden, external disruptions to their comfort zones.</b><br><br>This requires continuous, often stressful psychological adjustments to maintain inner equilibrium during unexpected domestic or familial shifts.",
    "uranus_conjunction_mercury": "<b>The mind operates like a lightning rod, capable of brilliant flashes of genius, rapid synthesis, and highly inventive problem-solving.</b><br><br>However, this hyper-aroused intellect can also lead to severe nervous tension, scattered thoughts, and a fiercely contrarian communication style.",
    "uranus_sextile_mercury": "<b>This aspect bestows an agile, progressive intellect that is highly receptive to new technologies and avant-garde ideas.</b><br><br>The individual is a naturally engaging communicator who can easily translate complex or radical concepts to others.",
    "uranus_square_mercury": "<b>The thought processes are erratic and highly rebellious, often leading the individual to speak out of turn or deliberately shock others with their opinions.</b><br><br>They must work to ground their intellectual brilliance so it doesn't manifest purely as argumentative or mentally exhausting behavior.",
    "uranus_trine_mercury": "<b>A beautifully synchronized flow of higher insight and logical deduction creates a mind well-suited for science, astrology, or technological innovation.</b><br><br>The individual effortlessly absorbs futuristic concepts and applies original thinking to everyday problems.",
    "uranus_opposition_mercury": "<b>The individual frequently encounters mental opposition, projecting their own argumentative or contrarian ideas onto others.</b><br><br>They are prone to sudden intellectual disputes and must learn to listen rather than merely waiting for a chance to disrupt the conversation.",
    "uranus_quincunx_mercury": "<b>There is a blind spot between how the individual communicates and the sudden, disruptive consequences of their words.</b><br><br>They frequently need to adjust their mental frameworks to accommodate shocking new information that doesn't fit their logical paradigms.",
    "uranus_conjunction_venus": "<b>Love, aesthetics, and values are fused with a need for absolute freedom, resulting in sudden attractions and highly unconventional relationships.</b><br><br>The individual rebels against traditional relationship models, requiring a partner who is both a friend and an intellectual equal.",
    "uranus_sextile_venus": "<b>The individual easily attracts exciting, progressive relationships and possesses a uniquely modern or avant-garde aesthetic.</b><br><br>They handle matters of love and money with a refreshing openness, comfortably giving their partners the space they need to grow.",
    "uranus_square_venus": "<b>A deep-seated tension exists between the desire for intimacy and an overriding fear of being trapped or suffocated in love.</b><br><br>This often manifests as a pattern of sudden, dramatic breakups or an attraction to highly unavailable, eccentric partners.",
    "uranus_trine_venus": "<b>Love and freedom are harmoniously integrated, allowing the individual to enjoy exciting, intellectually stimulating relationships without volatility.</b><br><br>They possess an effortless, magnetic charm that draws in unique people and unexpected financial opportunities.",
    "uranus_opposition_venus": "<b>The individual projects their need for space onto relationships, often experiencing a push-pull dynamic of intense closeness followed by abrupt distancing.</b><br><br>To find harmony, they must integrate their own need for autonomy rather than relying on partners to act out the rebellion.",
    "uranus_quincunx_venus": "<b>There is an awkward friction between the individual's desire for affection and the sudden, disruptive ways love enters or leaves their life.</b><br><br>They are constantly forced to adjust their values and relationship expectations in response to unpredictable external variables.",
    "uranus_conjunction_mars": "<b>This explosive aspect combines physical drive with erratic rebellion, creating a fiercely independent individual prone to sudden bursts of courageous or reckless action.</b><br><br>Their energy is highly electric, driving them to break barriers and act as a relentless force for rapid innovation.",
    "uranus_sextile_mars": "<b>The individual possesses a dynamic, progressive drive that allows them to implement radical changes with strategic efficiency.</b><br><br>They channel their need for excitement into constructive, forward-thinking actions without unnecessary volatility.",
    "uranus_square_mars": "<b>Extreme volatility and impulsiveness mark this aspect, as the individual frequently acts out against restrictions with sudden, explosive anger.</b><br><br>They must learn to consciously channel their massive, erratic energy into physical exertion or innovation to avoid accidents or destructive conflicts.",
    "uranus_trine_mars": "<b>Action and innovation flow effortlessly together, gifting the individual with boundless energy for progressive causes and technological pursuits.</b><br><br>They are decisive and highly effective in crisis situations, easily breaking through obstacles with brilliant originality.",
    "uranus_opposition_mars": "<b>The individual often externalizes their own explosive energy, attracting aggressive or highly unpredictable people into their life.</b><br><br>They must learn to own their fiercely independent drive to avoid constant, sudden confrontations with those who try to control them.",
    "uranus_quincunx_mars": "<b>The timing of the individual's actions is frequently out of sync with external events, leading to sudden, frustrating missteps.</b><br><br>They must constantly adjust their physical strategies and manage underlying nervous tension to avoid accidental disruptions.",
    "uranus_conjunction_jupiter": "<b>This signature indicates sudden windfalls, rapid expansions of consciousness, and a profoundly revolutionary belief system.</b><br><br>The individual relies on intuitive leaps to find meaning, often pioneering new philosophical, spiritual, or technological paradigms.",
    "uranus_sextile_jupiter": "<b>Opportunities for growth and expansion come easily through progressive networks, scientific pursuits, and an open-minded approach to life.</b><br><br>The individual naturally attracts luck by remaining adaptable and embracing unconventional philosophies.",
    "uranus_square_jupiter": "<b>A tension exists between the urge to expand rapidly and a tendency to take reckless, overly optimistic risks.</b><br><br>The individual may suddenly abandon established belief systems or overcommit to radical causes without practical foresight.",
    "uranus_trine_jupiter": "<b>The individual is blessed with incredible foresight, easily surfing the waves of future trends and cultural shifts to their advantage.</b><br><br>They experience harmonious breakthroughs in their philosophical understanding, using their innovative vision to inspire and uplift others.",
    "uranus_opposition_jupiter": "<b>The individual frequently oscillates between dogmatic faith and absolute rebellion against established societal frameworks.</b><br><br>They must balance their desire for unbounded freedom with a more grounded approach to philosophical and spiritual expansion.",
    "uranus_quincunx_jupiter": "<b>There is a persistent need to adjust one's long-term visions and moral compass in response to unexpected, disruptive events.</b><br><br>The individual often feels that their philosophical ideals are awkwardly out of step with the sudden realities they face.",
    "uranus_conjunction_saturn": "<b>This powerful alignment fuses the forces of structure and disruption, forcing the individual to build entirely new systems out of the ashes of the old.</b><br><br>They are tasked with grounding radical innovations into practical reality, serving as architects of the future.",
    "uranus_sextile_saturn": "<b>The individual smoothly integrates tradition with innovation, knowing exactly when to rely on structure and when to introduce progressive change.</b><br><br>They possess an excellent capacity for disciplined, original work in scientific or organizational fields.",
    "uranus_square_saturn": "<b>A profound, often painful psychological battle rages between the need for security and the compulsion to destroy limiting structures.</b><br><br>The individual may experience sudden collapses of the frameworks they build until they learn to incorporate flexibility into their foundations.",
    "uranus_trine_saturn": "<b>This highly constructive aspect allows the individual to manifest their revolutionary ideas into enduring, tangible forms.</b><br><br>They have a natural authority in progressive fields, efficiently organizing complex, futuristic projects with disciplined ease.",
    "uranus_opposition_saturn": "<b>The individual is caught in a lifelong tug-of-war between conformity to authority and radical rebellion against the establishment.</b><br><br>They often project this conflict outward, clashing with inflexible institutions or sudden, disruptive societal changes.",
    "uranus_quincunx_saturn": "<b>There is an uncomfortable, ongoing requirement to adjust one's boundaries and responsibilities in the face of unexpected disruptions.</b><br><br>The individual must constantly recalibrate their sense of duty to accommodate sudden shifts in the rules they live by.",
    "uranus_conjunction_neptune": "<b>This generation merges technological brilliance with spiritual idealism, seeking to revolutionize humanity's connection to the divine.</b><br><br>Psychologically, it indicates a profound awakening of the collective unconscious, though it can lead to massive societal delusions if not grounded.",
    "uranus_sextile_neptune": "<b>This aspect bestows a natural, flowing intuition that seamlessly blends innovative thinking with deep spiritual compassion.</b><br><br>The individual easily utilizes progressive mediums like film, technology, or modern psychology to uplift and heal the collective.",
    "uranus_square_neptune": "<b>There is a severe friction between the desire for radical truth and the temptation to escape into technological or spiritual illusions.</b><br><br>The individual may experience sudden shatterings of their idealized visions, forcing them to find a more authentic spiritual grounding.",
    "uranus_trine_neptune": "<b>Mysticism and science are beautifully synthesized, giving the individual profound, visionary foresight and a highly evolved imagination.</b><br><br>They naturally channel higher-dimensional concepts into artistic or technological creations that inspire collective awakening.",
    "uranus_opposition_neptune": "<b>This generational polarity pits the urge for harsh, objective scientific truth against the need for spiritual interconnectedness.</b><br><br>Psychologically, the individual must integrate their highly rational intellect with their sensitive, imaginative soul without splitting the two.",
    "uranus_quincunx_neptune": "<b>The individual struggles to reconcile sudden, jarring flashes of reality with their deeply held spiritual fantasies.</b><br><br>They must constantly adjust their ideals to accommodate unexpected, disruptive variables that challenge their faith.",
    "uranus_conjunction_pluto": "<b>This incredibly potent generational signature heralds massive, cataclysmic societal changes, destroying old power structures to build anew.</b><br><br>Psychologically, it points to individuals who experience sudden, traumatic, but deeply regenerative metamorphoses of the soul.",
    "uranus_sextile_pluto": "<b>This aspect indicates a generation capable of profound, steady transformation, utilizing innovation to reform deep-seated power dynamics.</b><br><br>The individual possesses a subtle but powerful psychological insight, intuitively knowing how to implement progressive change effectively.",
    "uranus_square_pluto": "<b>Marked by intense, explosive periods of collective upheaval, this aspect forces the individual to navigate deep societal unrest and personal crises.</b><br><br>They are driven by a ruthless need to overthrow oppressive forces, often experiencing sudden power struggles that demand total psychological surrender.",
    "uranus_trine_pluto": "<b>The forces of sudden change and deep psychological empowerment flow together harmoniously, allowing for highly effective, constructive revolutions.</b><br><br>The individual naturally commands authority in progressive fields, wielding their innovative insight to heal and transform society.",
    "uranus_opposition_pluto": "<b>A fierce, polarizing battle exists between the need for radical freedom and the deep-seated urge for absolute control.</b><br><br>The individual often faces sudden, overwhelming external crises that force them to release their grip on power and embrace radical vulnerability.",
    "uranus_quincunx_pluto": "<b>There is a constant, nagging friction between sudden, liberating changes and the deep, dark psychological attachments holding the individual back.</b><br><br>They are frequently required to adjust their survival strategies in the face of unexpected, transformative shocks.",
    "uranus_conjunction_chiron": "<b>This aspect points to a profound core wound surrounding feelings of alienation, sudden abandonment, or being perceived as an outcast.</b><br><br>Healing occurs when the individual completely embraces their uniqueness, using their highly sensitive nervous system to pioneer alternative healing modalities.",
    "uranus_sextile_chiron": "<b>The individual possesses a natural, intuitive talent for helping others process sudden trauma or nervous system dysregulation.</b><br><br>They easily blend innovative techniques with deep empathy to foster unconventional but highly effective healing environments.",
    "uranus_square_chiron": "<b>A tense, volatile friction exists between the urge to rebel and a deep-seated wound of feeling perpetually misunderstood by society.</b><br><br>Sudden crises often trigger acute psychological pain, forcing the individual to urgently confront and integrate their feelings of alienation.",
    "uranus_trine_chiron": "<b>Brilliant, sudden flashes of insight allow the individual to rapidly heal their own psychic wounds and those of others.</b><br><br>They naturally channel their eccentricities into a unique therapeutic approach, turning their past trauma into a profound source of innovative wisdom.",
    "uranus_opposition_chiron": "<b>The individual frequently projects their inner wounds of alienation onto others, attracting erratic or deeply wounded partners.</b><br><br>Healing requires them to stop using their eccentricities as a defensive shield against intimacy and to objectively address their own sudden emotional triggers.",
    "uranus_quincunx_chiron": "<b>There is an uncomfortable, lingering tension between the individual's need for radical independence and sudden, unpredictable recurrences of past wounds.</b><br><br>They must continuously adjust their healing strategies to accommodate unexpected psychological triggers that disrupt their equilibrium.",
    "uranus_conjunction_north_node": "<b>The individual's soul destiny is inextricably linked to being an innovator, a rebel, or an agent of societal awakening.</b><br><br>They are compelled to move toward the unknown, utilizing technology or radical new paradigms to fulfill their highest evolutionary purpose.",
    "uranus_sextile_north_node": "<b>Opportunities for soul growth arrive through unconventional networks, progressive friendships, and sudden, insightful flashes of intuition.</b><br><br>The individual easily integrates their unique genius into their life path without alienating their community.",
    "uranus_square_north_node": "<b>The individual's profound need for independence frequently distracts or derails them from their true evolutionary path.</b><br><br>They must learn to balance their erratic, rebellious urges with a committed focus on their long-term spiritual destiny.",
    "uranus_trine_north_node": "<b>The path to karmic fulfillment is paved with sudden, fortuitous breakthroughs and a natural talent for future-oriented thinking.</b><br><br>The individual effortlessly attracts progressive mentors and unique circumstances that rapidly accelerate their soul's evolution.",
    "uranus_opposition_north_node": "<b>The individual often defaults to the South Node's comfort zone by relying on erratic, disconnected behaviors that hinder their growth.</b><br><br>They must consciously integrate their innovative brilliance into their future goals rather than using rebellion as an escape mechanism.",
    "uranus_quincunx_north_node": "<b>The individual experiences awkward, sudden detours on their life path that require them to continuously reassess their karmic trajectory.</b><br><br>They must learn to adapt their unique insights to their soul's purpose, even when the circumstances feel jarring.",
    "uranus_conjunction_south_node": "<b>This placement suggests a past life or early life heavily conditioned by instability, rebellion, or sudden trauma.</b><br><br>To evolve, the individual must release their ingrained tendency to unexpectedly sever ties, learning to cultivate stability rather than constant disruption.",
    "uranus_sextile_south_node": "<b>The individual brings forward inherent talents for innovation and objective thinking from past experiences, effortlessly applying them to present challenges.</b><br><br>This natural genius acts as a supportive foundation without trapping the individual in past-life erraticism.",
    "uranus_square_south_node": "<b>Deeply ingrained patterns of sudden rebellion and a fear of entrapment constantly disrupt the individual's karmic balance.</b><br><br>They must confront these inherited psychological shocks to stop the cycle of unnecessary, self-inflicted life upheavals.",
    "uranus_trine_south_node": "<b>Past-life mastery of astrology, science, or progressive ideals provides a comforting, highly intuitive baseline for the individual.</b><br><br>They easily draw upon this innate brilliance, utilizing it as a harmonious tool to navigate their current incarnation.",
    "uranus_opposition_south_node": "<b>By fulfilling their North Node destiny of innovation, they naturally pull away from the stagnation of their past-life karmic loops.</b><br><br>The individual is pushed to use their rebellious energy progressively rather than falling back into outdated, isolating habits.",
    "uranus_quincunx_south_node": "<b>Sudden, unresolved energetic echoes from the past frequently interrupt the individual's present stability, causing uncomfortable friction.</b><br><br>They must consciously adjust their nervous system responses to heal these inherited, unpredictable psychic shocks.",
    "uranus_conjunction_ceres": "<b>The individual's approach to nurturing and caregiving is highly erratic, fiercely independent, and completely non-traditional.</b><br><br>They find comfort in environmentalism, technological advancements in agriculture, and advocating for radical changes in how society sustains itself.",
    "uranus_sextile_ceres": "<b>Providing and receiving care flows easily through progressive networks, alternative therapies, and a modern approach to family dynamics.</b><br><br>The individual intuitively knows how to give others the exact amount of freedom they need to feel truly supported.",
    "uranus_square_ceres": "<b>There is a painful clash between the primal need to be nurtured and a compulsive urge to break free from maternal bonds.</b><br><br>The individual may experience sudden disruptions in their food supply, domestic life, or relationship with their own children, requiring profound psychological adjustment.",
    "uranus_trine_ceres": "<b>The individual seamlessly integrates innovative practices into their caregiving, parenting, and relationship with the natural world.</b><br><br>They possess a natural genius for modernizing agricultural, nutritional, or ecological systems to benefit the wider collective.",
    "uranus_opposition_ceres": "<b>The individual often feels torn between their duty to nurture others and their desperate need for absolute personal autonomy.</b><br><br>They may attract highly unstable dependents or caregivers, forcing them to learn how to nurture without sacrificing their independence.",
    "uranus_quincunx_ceres": "<b>Sudden, unpredictable events frequently disrupt the individual's ability to provide or receive consistent care and emotional sustenance.</b><br><br>They must learn to adapt their nurturing style on the fly, finding comfort in unconventional or constantly shifting domestic routines.",
    "uranus_conjunction_pallas": "<b>This aspect creates a mind of pure, unfiltered genius, capable of stunning strategic foresight and technological invention.</b><br><br>The individual is a natural architect of progressive social movements, using their brilliant pattern recognition to dismantle outmoded systems.",
    "uranus_sextile_pallas": "<b>The individual easily channels their inventive intellect into practical, strategic solutions for the benefit of their community.</b><br><br>They possess a natural talent for objective, non-linear problem solving, making them excellent forward-thinking advisors.",
    "uranus_square_pallas": "<b>A hyper-active, erratic intellect often leads to brilliant but highly ungrounded or overly radical strategies that alienate others.</b><br><br>The individual must learn to temper their revolutionary ideas with patience, ensuring their sudden insights are practically applicable.",
    "uranus_trine_pallas": "<b>The individual is a visionary strategist, effortlessly integrating futuristic concepts into highly successful, creative problem-solving methods.</b><br><br>They naturally perceive the underlying energetic grids of society and know exactly how to innovate without causing destructive chaos.",
    "uranus_opposition_pallas": "<b>The individual frequently finds their radical ideas directly opposed by the intellectual or strategic frameworks of others.</b><br><br>They must learn to collaborate and compromise, recognizing that true genius requires the ability to translate radical concepts to the uninitiated.",
    "uranus_quincunx_pallas": "<b>There is a constant, awkward need to adjust one's intellectual strategies to accommodate suddenly shifting, unpredictable variables.</b><br><br>The individual often feels that their brilliant plans are disrupted by external shocks, requiring immense mental flexibility.",
    "uranus_conjunction_juno": "<b>The individual demands absolute autonomy and intellectual stimulation within their marriages and committed partnerships.</b><br><br>They frequently choose highly unconventional relationship structures, rejecting traditional vows in favor of unions based on radical equality and freedom.",
    "uranus_sextile_juno": "<b>Commitments are maintained through a healthy respect for mutual independence, open communication, and shared progressive ideals.</b><br><br>The individual easily attracts partners who are both their intellectual equal and their best friend.",
    "uranus_square_juno": "<b>A severe tension exists between the desire for a committed partnership and an overriding fear of losing personal freedom.</b><br><br>This often results in a pattern of sudden marriages, abrupt divorces, and intense instability in long-term relational commitments.",
    "uranus_trine_juno": "<b>The individual naturally sustains long-term commitments by keeping the relationship electric, exciting, and constantly evolving.</b><br><br>They effortlessly balance their deep need for autonomy with their devotion to a partner who champions their unique eccentricities.",
    "uranus_opposition_juno": "<b>The individual frequently projects their own erratic, commitment-phobic tendencies onto their partners, attracting highly unstable mates.</b><br><br>To find peace, they must own their need for space and consciously build relationships that inherently allow for vast personal freedom.",
    "uranus_quincunx_juno": "<b>The individual struggles with unexpected external events that constantly disrupt the stability of their committed partnerships.</b><br><br>They are frequently required to make awkward, uncomfortable adjustments to their relationship expectations in order to maintain the bond.",
    "uranus_conjunction_vesta": "<b>The individual's spiritual devotion and capacity for intense focus are channeled entirely into progressive, avant-garde, or technological pursuits.</b><br><br>They possess a brilliant but highly erratic work ethic, dedicating themselves completely to a cause before suddenly shifting their focus entirely.",
    "uranus_sextile_vesta": "<b>The individual smoothly integrates their need for independence into their sacred duties, working tirelessly for humanitarian or scientific causes.</b><br><br>They find deep spiritual fulfillment in modernizing traditions and creating innovative, highly efficient systems of service.",
    "uranus_square_vesta": "<b>A tense inner conflict rages between the desire to dedicate oneself to a higher calling and the restless urge to constantly rebel.</b><br><br>The individual may suddenly abandon their spiritual or professional commitments when they feel their personal freedom is being compromised.",
    "uranus_trine_vesta": "<b>Visionary insight and sacred devotion flow together perfectly, allowing the individual to manifest groundbreaking work with hyper-focused brilliance.</b><br><br>They naturally sustain their energy by dedicating themselves to truly authentic, futuristic goals that serve the collective awakening.",
    "uranus_opposition_vesta": "<b>The individual frequently finds that their radical need for independence directly opposes the sacred duties or commitments expected of them.</b><br><br>They must learn to honor their spiritual focus without allowing traditional expectations to suppress their innovative spirit.",
    "uranus_quincunx_vesta": "<b>There is an uncomfortable friction between the individual's spiritual rituals and the sudden, chaotic disruptions of the modern world.</b><br><br>They must continuously adapt their methods of focus and devotion to accommodate an ever-changing, unpredictable environment.",
    "uranus_conjunction_ascendant": "<b>The individual projects an immediate aura of electric intensity, fierce independence, and undeniable eccentricity.</b><br><br>They are wired for constant reinvention, often experiencing sudden shifts in physical appearance, personal identity, and how they initiate action in the world.",
    "uranus_sextile_ascendant": "<b>The individual's unique, progressive nature is easily and pleasantly expressed, naturally drawing others toward their exciting persona.</b><br><br>They navigate social environments with an effortless, friendly detachment that makes them universally intriguing.",
    "uranus_square_ascendant": "<b>A profound tension exists between the individual's core identity and their erratic, often shocking interactions with the public.</b><br><br>They may frequently act out rebelliously in ways that unintentionally alienate them from others, requiring them to conscious ground their nervous energy.",
    "uranus_trine_ascendant": "<b>The individual possesses a magnetic, highly authentic charm that effortlessly blends their unique eccentricities with their outer persona.</b><br><br>They are naturally viewed as visionary trailblazers, easily initiating progressive changes that inspire everyone around them.",
    "uranus_opposition_ascendant": "<b>Also conjunct the Descendant, this aspect points to a life where sudden changes and awakenings are constantly triggered by interpersonal relationships.</b><br><br>The individual often attracts highly eccentric or unstable partners who act as mirrors for their own unacknowledged need for radical freedom.",
    "uranus_quincunx_ascendant": "<b>The individual experiences a persistent, awkward disconnect between their internal need for change and how they are perceived by the world.</b><br><br>They frequently have to adjust their outward behavior to manage sudden, unexpected reactions from their environment.",
    "uranus_conjunction_descendant": "<b>The individual is intensely drawn to brilliant, erratic, or highly unconventional partners who refuse to conform to societal norms.</b><br><br>Their one-on-one relationships are marked by sudden beginnings and endings, requiring absolute freedom and intellectual stimulation to survive.",
    "uranus_sextile_descendant": "<b>The individual effortlessly attracts open-minded, progressive partnerships that support their personal growth and need for space.</b><br><br>They navigate contracts and interpersonal dynamics with a refreshing objectivity that prevents toxic enmeshment.",
    "uranus_square_descendant": "<b>There is a constant, volatile friction between the individual's personal path and their ability to maintain stable partnerships.</b><br><br>They often experience sudden, disruptive conflicts with others, driven by a deep-seated fear of losing their independence in relationships.",
    "uranus_trine_descendant": "<b>The individual naturally forms harmonious, exciting alliances with visionary people who champion their unique individuality.</b><br><br>Their relationships are inherently liberating, functioning as a beautiful blend of deep friendship and mutual respect for autonomy.",
    "uranus_opposition_descendant": "<b>Also conjunct the Ascendant, the individual frequently projects their own erratic, rebellious nature onto their partners and open enemies.</b><br><br>They must learn to own their intense need for independence rather than constantly fighting against the constraints they perceive others placing on them.",
    "uranus_quincunx_descendant": "<b>The individual struggles to reconcile their desire for partnership with the sudden, unpredictable ways others behave.</b><br><br>They must constantly make awkward adjustments in their relationships to deal with the erratic nature of the people they attract.",
    "uranus_conjunction_mc": "<b>The individual's career path and public reputation are marked by sudden shifts, brilliant innovation, and a refusal to conform to traditional authority.</b><br><br>They are known as visionaries or disruptors in their field, often pioneering new technologies or radical societal structures.",
    "uranus_sextile_mc": "<b>Opportunities for professional advancement come easily through the individual's progressive networking and forward-thinking ideas.</b><br><br>They smoothly integrate their unique genius into their career, naturally assuming roles as modern, objective leaders.",
    "uranus_square_mc": "<b>A profound tension exists between the individual's private need for domestic freedom and the sudden, erratic demands of their public life.</b><br><br>They often experience dramatic, unexpected career changes or public clashes with authority figures as they fight to maintain their autonomy.",
    "uranus_trine_mc": "<b>The individual effortlessly surfs the waves of cultural change, naturally aligning their career goals with the futuristic needs of society.</b><br><br>Their professional life is highly exciting and authentic, bringing them public recognition for their visionary contributions.",
    "uranus_opposition_mc": "<b>Also conjunct the IC, the individual's public life is constantly disrupted by sudden upheavals or radical changes within their home and family.</b><br><br>They must learn to ground their erratic private life to establish any lasting stability in their professional world.",
    "uranus_quincunx_mc": "<b>The individual frequently encounters sudden, awkward detours in their career path that force them to reassess their public goals.</b><br><br>They must constantly adjust their professional strategies to accommodate unpredictable shifts in their industry or reputation.",
    "uranus_conjunction_ic": "<b>The foundation of the individual's life is inherently restless, often marked by a highly unconventional childhood, sudden relocations, or ancestral trauma.</b><br><br>To find true inner peace, they must completely redefine what &quot;home&quot; means, anchoring their security in their own radical independence.",
    "uranus_sextile_ic": "<b>The individual easily creates a liberating, progressive home environment that beautifully supports their psychological need for freedom.</b><br><br>They have a natural ability to process family history objectively, breaking ancestral patterns without unnecessary drama.",
    "uranus_square_ic": "<b>There is a deeply rooted, volatile friction between the individual's public ambitions and the chaotic, unpredictable nature of their private life.</b><br><br>Sudden domestic crises frequently disrupt their sense of foundational security, demanding intense psychological adjustment.",
    "uranus_trine_ic": "<b>The individual seamlessly integrates non-traditional living arrangements and modern technology into their deeply comforting home life.</b><br><br>They possess a profound, intuitive understanding of their psychological roots, effortlessly freeing themselves from inherited familial conditioning.",
    "uranus_opposition_ic": "<b>Also conjunct the MC, the individual frequently projects their inner sense of rootlessness onto their career, constantly changing professional directions.</b><br><br>They must learn to resolve their deep-seated childhood restlessness rather than constantly seeking liberation through public rebellion.",
    "uranus_quincunx_ic": "<b>The individual experiences a persistent, uncomfortable need to adjust their living situations in response to sudden, unexpected external variables.</b><br><br>They often feel a jarring disconnect between their internal emotional foundation and the erratic reality of their domestic life.",
    "uranus_conjunction_fortune": "<b>The individual's greatest joy and worldly success are found through fully embracing their eccentricities and pioneering innovative, avant-garde concepts.</b><br><br>Sudden windfalls and profound happiness occur when they completely detach from societal expectations and act as agents of progressive change.",
    "uranus_sextile_fortune": "<b>Opportunities for joy and prosperity naturally flow to the individual when they utilize their objective, forward-thinking intellect.</b><br><br>They easily attract beneficial circumstances by remaining adaptable and actively engaging with progressive communities or technologies.",
    "uranus_square_fortune": "<b>The individual's compulsive need to rebel frequently sabotages their own opportunities for success and inner fulfillment.</b><br><br>They must learn to differentiate between authentic innovation and mindless contrarianism to achieve the happiness they deeply desire.",
    "uranus_trine_fortune": "<b>A beautiful harmony exists between the individual's unique genius and their capacity to attract sudden, extraordinary luck.</b><br><br>They effortlessly align themselves with the futuristic currents of society, finding immense joy in their role as a visionary creator.",
    "uranus_opposition_fortune": "<b>The individual often feels that external disruptions and erratic people constantly block their path to personal joy and success.</b><br><br>They must learn to integrate their own unacknowledged need for radical change rather than viewing it as a force that actively opposes their happiness.",
    "uranus_quincunx_fortune": "<b>The individual is frequently forced to adjust their definition of success to accommodate sudden, jarring life changes that disrupt their plans.</b><br><br>They must cultivate profound flexibility to find joy amidst the unpredictable variables that constantly reshape their path.",
    "uranus_conjunction_lilith": "<b>This incredibly potent aspect fuses raw, primal feminine power with sudden, electric rebellion, creating an absolute intolerance for subjugation.</b><br><br>The individual's deepest taboos and sexual autonomy are expressed in shocking, revolutionary ways that demand total, unapologetic liberation from patriarchal norms.",
    "uranus_sextile_lilith": "<b>The individual effortlessly channels their raw, untamed shadow energy into progressive, liberating creative or intellectual pursuits.</b><br><br>They possess a natural, objective understanding of societal taboos, using their unique perspective to quietly but powerfully dismantle oppressive structures.",
    "uranus_square_lilith": "<b>A fierce, highly volatile inner war rages between the individual's need for social integration and their repressed, explosive shadow desires.</b><br><br>This often manifests as sudden, destructive acts of rebellion or intense sexual crises as they fight to integrate their most exiled aspects.",
    "uranus_trine_lilith": "<b>The individual seamlessly integrates their primal shadow with their visionary intellect, possessing a magnetic and wildly authentic aura.</b><br><br>They naturally utilize their understanding of the taboo to initiate profound psychological and societal awakenings without fear of exile.",
    "uranus_opposition_lilith": "<b>The individual frequently projects their own terrifying, untamed shadow qualities onto others, attracting highly erratic or transgressive partners.</b><br><br>They must directly confront and integrate their deepest fears of societal rejection to stop externalizing this chaotic, rebellious energy.",
    "uranus_quincunx_lilith": "<b>There is a persistent, deeply uncomfortable friction between the individual's sudden flashes of insight and their suppressed, primal wounds.</b><br><br>They must continuously, awkwardly adjust their understanding of their own autonomy to integrate the shocking, taboo desires that unexpectedly surface from their unconscious.",
    "neptune_conjunction_sun": "<b>This aspect merges the core identity with the limitless ocean of the collective unconscious, creating a highly sensitive, empathetic, and porous sense of self.</b><br><br>The individual may struggle with boundary formulation but possesses profound artistic, spiritual, or healing potentials that shape their essential life purpose.",
    "neptune_sextile_sun": "<b>A natural, harmonious flow exists between the native's conscious ego and their spiritual or imaginative faculties, allowing them to easily channel inspiration.</b><br><br>They possess a gentle, compassionate charisma that naturally draws others to their creative visions without overwhelming their core identity.",
    "neptune_square_sun": "<b>The native experiences a persistent psychological friction between their concrete ego-drives and an alluring, yet confusing, world of fantasy and spiritual yearning.</b><br><br>They must actively battle self-deception, a draining of physical vitality, and the tendency to undermine their own success through escapist behaviors.",
    "neptune_trine_sun": "<b>The individual's life path is graced with a fluid, almost magical alignment of personal will and divine inspiration, fostering supreme artistic or mystical talents.</b><br><br>They exude a natural aura of healing and compassion, effortlessly integrating their spiritual ideals into their conscious self-expression.",
    "neptune_opposition_sun": "<b>The native often projects their own spiritual ideals, confusion, or need for salvation onto the external world and other people.</b><br><br>They may experience recurring crises of identity where their sense of self feels washed away by external circumstances, forcing them to develop rigorous internal boundaries.",
    "neptune_quincunx_sun": "<b>There is a constant, awkward adjustment required between the individual's conscious goals and their vague, yet persistent, spiritual or imaginative longings.</b><br><br>They often feel misunderstood, requiring deliberate effort to reconcile their practical need for recognition with their subtle, boundary-dissolving sensitivities.",
    "neptune_conjunction_moon": "<b>The emotional core is exceptionally fluid, absorbing the feelings of others like a psychic sponge and granting unparalleled empathetic depth.</b><br><br>The native possesses an incredibly rich inner fantasy life but must fiercely guard against emotional codependency and the inability to distinguish their own feelings from their environment.",
    "neptune_sextile_moon": "<b>Emotional security is gently supported by a rich imagination and a natural, intuitive connection to the hidden emotional currents of others.</b><br><br>This harmonious aspect fosters a nurturing, sympathetic disposition that excels in domestic artistry and creating a spiritually soothing home environment.",
    "neptune_square_moon": "<b>The native's emotional needs clash with an idealized, often unrealistic fantasy of how life, family, or nurturing should be.</b><br><br>This friction can lead to deep emotional disillusionment, a tendency to play the victim or savior in relationships, and a vulnerability to emotional escapism.",
    "neptune_trine_moon": "<b>The unconscious mind and emotional instincts flow seamlessly into the realm of spirit and imagination, granting profound psychic and artistic gifts.</b><br><br>The individual experiences a deep, inner serenity and an innate ability to offer effortless emotional healing to those around them.",
    "neptune_opposition_moon": "<b>Emotional relationships are fraught with boundary issues, as the native oscillates between extreme empathetic merging and a desperate need to escape emotional overwhelm.</b><br><br>They often attract needy or elusive individuals, demanding a conscious effort to ground their emotional reactions in reality rather than romantic projection.",
    "neptune_quincunx_moon": "<b>The native's emotional comfort zone feels inherently at odds with their spiritual or imaginative drives, creating a subtle, persistent internal restlessness.</b><br><br>They must learn to bridge the gap between their everyday emotional responses and their overwhelming, nebulous sensitivities without resorting to psychosomatic coping mechanisms.",
    "neptune_conjunction_mercury": "<b>The cognitive processes are drenched in imagination, making the individual a highly intuitive thinker who communicates through symbols, poetry, and imagery.</b><br><br>While capable of profound artistic or mystical articulation, they must guard against self-deception, absent-mindedness, and the tendency to obscure the truth through overly subjective reasoning.",
    "neptune_sextile_mercury": "<b>The mind naturally bridges logic and intuition, allowing the native to elegantly express complex spiritual or artistic concepts.</b><br><br>This supportive aspect makes them excellent listeners, compassionate communicators, and adept at reading between the lines of human interaction.",
    "neptune_square_mercury": "<b>The rational intellect is in constant tension with the abstract, boundary-dissolving world of imagination, leading to mental confusion or profound miscommunications.</b><br><br>The native must rigorously discipline their mind to avoid logical fallacies, deceptive phrasing, and the anxiety born of mental overwhelm.",
    "neptune_trine_mercury": "<b>Intuition and intellect operate in a harmonious synthesis, granting the native a visionary mind capable of translating the ethereal into the comprehensible.</b><br><br>They possess a soothing, hypnotic communication style that effortlessly inspires and spiritually uplifts their audience.",
    "neptune_opposition_mercury": "<b>The native's perception of reality frequently clashes with external facts, making them prone to misunderstandings or feeling gaslit by the objective world.</b><br><br>They must consciously work to separate objective truth from their highly idealized or paranoid projections when engaging in dialogue.",
    "neptune_quincunx_mercury": "<b>There is a frustrating disconnect between how the native thinks and how they experience spiritual or imaginative inspiration, often leading to disjointed communication.</b><br><br>They must cultivate patience in their mental processes, learning to integrate their vivid intuition without short-circuiting their practical intellect.",
    "neptune_conjunction_venus": "<b>Love, aesthetics, and values are elevated to an intensely romantic, spiritualized, and often unrealistic ideal.</b><br><br>The native seeks a transcendent, soul-mate connection and possesses exquisite artistic sensibilities, but they are deeply vulnerable to heartbreak when their idealized partners reveal human flaws.",
    "neptune_sextile_venus": "<b>A gentle, refined romanticism flavors the native's relationships and artistic pursuits, offering opportunities for graceful social and creative interactions.</b><br><br>They easily attract beauty and spiritual connection into their lives, maintaining a compassionate, forgiving approach to those they love.",
    "neptune_square_venus": "<b>The desire for connection conflicts with an addiction to the fantasy of love, often leading the native into deceptive, unrequited, or codependent relationships.</b><br><br>They must confront their tendency to over-value the aesthetic or spiritual potential of a partner while ignoring the harsh, practical realities of the relationship.",
    "neptune_trine_venus": "<b>Love and spiritual devotion flow as one, blessing the native with a profoundly open, empathetic heart and a genius for artistic manifestation.</b><br><br>They possess an almost magical ability to romanticize their reality, experiencing relationships as a source of divine inspiration and effortless harmony.",
    "neptune_opposition_venus": "<b>The native frequently projects their ultimate romantic ideals onto others, setting the stage for inevitable disillusionment when the illusion shatters.</b><br><br>They must overcome the pattern of seeking a savior or playing the martyr in love, learning to establish firm boundaries to protect their inherent self-worth.",
    "neptune_quincunx_venus": "<b>The individual's aesthetic tastes and relationship needs require constant, uncomfortable adjustments to accommodate their confusing spiritual longings.</b><br><br>They may feel a perpetual, vague dissatisfaction in love, learning the hard way how to blend earthly affection with their need for transcendent romance.",
    "neptune_conjunction_mars": "<b>Personal drive, aggression, and sexual energy are suffused with mysticism, making actions highly motivated by ideals rather than practical ambition.</b><br><br>The native is capable of profound, inspired action or spiritual warfare, but they may struggle with misdirected energy, passive-aggression, or a paralyzing lack of physical stamina.",
    "neptune_sextile_mars": "<b>The individual's willpower is harmoniously supported by their imagination, allowing them to pursue their goals with a fluid, intuitive grace.</b><br><br>They excel in activities requiring subtle strategy, artistic physical expression, or defending the vulnerable with compassionate courage.",
    "neptune_square_mars": "<b>The native's assertive energy is frequently undermined by self-doubt, confusion, or a subconscious desire to escape conflict.</b><br><br>This frustrating tension can lead to deceitful actions, misdirected anger, or draining one's vitality by chasing unrealistic, phantom goals.",
    "neptune_trine_mars": "<b>Action and intuition are beautifully synchronized, granting the native the ability to move through life with a charismatic, almost mystical momentum.</b><br><br>They naturally channel their passions into artistic or spiritual endeavors, achieving their desires without needing to resort to brute force.",
    "neptune_opposition_mars": "<b>The individual's drive and assertiveness are constantly challenged or diffused by confusing external forces or deceptive adversaries.</b><br><br>They must learn to confront passive-aggressive dynamics directly, rather than projecting their own repressed anger or victimization onto the external world.",
    "neptune_quincunx_mars": "<b>A subtle irritation exists between the native's desire to act and their nebulous, shifting ideals, leading to hesitant or poorly timed initiatives.</b><br><br>They must learn to consciously align their physical energy with their spiritual vision to avoid chronic energy depletion or mysterious physical ailments.",
    "neptune_conjunction_jupiter": "<b>This alignment creates an immense, boundless reservoir of faith, optimism, and visionary idealism.</b><br><br>The native's spiritual and philosophical beliefs are expansive to the point of grandiosity, offering profound intuitive wisdom but carrying a significant risk of unchecked over-expansion and financial or spiritual gambling.",
    "neptune_sextile_jupiter": "<b>Opportunities for spiritual growth, higher learning, and philosophical understanding flow easily through the native's imaginative faculties.</b><br><br>They possess a generous, tolerant worldview that naturally attracts benefactors and allows their idealistic visions to find practical avenues of expression.",
    "neptune_square_jupiter": "<b>The native's desire for growth clashes with a lack of boundaries, leading to highly inflated expectations, spiritual bypassing, or fanatical beliefs.</b><br><br>They must rigorously check their tendency toward excess, as their optimism can easily morph into a blind, self-destructive delusion.",
    "neptune_trine_jupiter": "<b>Faith and imagination operate in perfect harmony, blessing the native with profound spiritual protection and an effortlessly optimistic worldview.</b><br><br>They possess a natural genius for visionary philosophy and can easily manifest their expansive dreams into a beautiful, inspiring reality.",
    "neptune_opposition_jupiter": "<b>The individual wrestles with a polarization between formal religious or philosophical doctrines and their own boundless, chaotic spiritual experiences.</b><br><br>They must navigate the tension between wanting to save the world and falling into grandiose, unrealistic expectations of what is actually possible.",
    "neptune_quincunx_jupiter": "<b>A continuous, awkward adjustment is required between the native's expansive social or philosophical goals and their vague, underlying spiritual sensitivities.</b><br><br>They often struggle to reconcile their big-picture optimism with the confusing, boundaryless reality of their inner dreamscape.",
    "neptune_conjunction_saturn": "<b>The principles of structure and reality merge with the forces of dissolution and illusion, creating a complex dynamic of spiritualizing matter or crystallizing dreams.</b><br><br>The native may struggle with deep-seated anxieties regarding their foundations, yet they possess the unique potential to build enduring, practical systems out of visionary ideals.",
    "neptune_sextile_saturn": "<b>The native's discipline and pragmatism are gently softened and supported by their intuition, allowing them to slowly and methodically actualize their dreams.</b><br><br>This aspect grants a structured approach to spiritual or artistic pursuits, ensuring that their imagination produces tangible, lasting results.",
    "neptune_square_saturn": "<b>A profound psychological friction exists between the native's need for security and control, and an undeniable urge to escape into boundaryless fantasy.</b><br><br>This can manifest as crippling self-doubt, where the harshness of reality constantly shatters their dreams, or where fear paralyzes their imaginative potential.",
    "neptune_trine_saturn": "<b>The structures of reality and the visions of the unconscious work in effortless synergy, allowing the native to manifest their ideals with masterful precision.</b><br><br>They possess a serene, mature wisdom, easily grounding their spiritual insights into reliable, pragmatic forms without losing their aesthetic magic.",
    "neptune_opposition_saturn": "<b>The individual faces a lifelong tug-of-war between their responsibilities in the material world and the dissolving, chaotic pull of the spiritual or imaginative realm.</b><br><br>They often feel that societal expectations are a prison, requiring them to learn the difficult balance of fulfilling their duties without sacrificing their soul's vision.",
    "neptune_quincunx_saturn": "<b>There is a persistent, irritating disconnect between the native's concrete obligations and their abstract, spiritual yearnings.</b><br><br>They must constantly tweak their approach to life, learning how to honor their need for structure without suffocating their delicate, imaginative sensitivities.",
    "neptune_conjunction_uranus": "<b>This powerful generational signature blends revolutionary awakening with boundless spiritual compassion, creating a deep collective drive to dismantle old paradigms for the sake of higher truth.</b><br><br>On a personal level, the native experiences sudden, electrical insights that dissolve the ego, making them a conduit for visionary, albeit sometimes highly disruptive, utopian ideals.",
    "neptune_sextile_uranus": "<b>The native naturally integrates progressive, innovative ideas with a compassionate, highly imaginative spiritual outlook.</b><br><br>This harmonious flow allows them to participate in collective awakening or technological advancement with an intuitive grace that deeply benefits humanity.",
    "neptune_square_uranus": "<b>A chaotic tension exists between the native's urge for sudden rebellion and their tendency toward confusion, escapism, or collective delusion.</b><br><br>They may struggle with highly erratic spiritual energies or nervous system overwhelm, requiring immense grounding to channel their revolutionary visions constructively.",
    "neptune_trine_uranus": "<b>Intuition and intellectual brilliance operate in a masterful synthesis, granting the native an effortless connection to the higher mind and the collective unconscious.</b><br><br>They are natural visionaries, easily bridging the gap between futuristic innovation and profound, boundary-dissolving spiritual wisdom.",
    "neptune_opposition_uranus": "<b>The individual experiences a deep polarization between the cold, rational detachment of progress and the overwhelming, emotional waters of collective empathy.</b><br><br>They must consciously integrate their need for sudden, radical freedom with their vulnerability to spiritual confusion and chaotic idealism.",
    "neptune_quincunx_uranus": "<b>A subtle, disjointed rhythm exists between the native's erratic urge for liberation and their nebulous, spiritual sensitivities.</b><br><br>They often feel a generalized anxiety as they attempt to reconcile their futuristic visions with the highly subjective, emotional reality of their intuitive experiences.",
    "neptune_conjunction_pluto": "<b>This extremely rare, generation-defining aspect merges the ultimate forces of death, rebirth, and power with the limitless, dissolving waters of the collective unconscious.</b><br><br>The native possesses an almost terrifying depth of psychological and occult power, tasked with completely transmuting the spiritual shadows and collective traumas of humanity.",
    "neptune_sextile_pluto": "<b>This incredibly long-lasting generational aspect provides a continuous, supportive undercurrent for the gradual, profound transformation of collective spiritual ideals.</b><br><br>It grants the native a deep, natural psychological resilience and the ability to channel intense transformative energy through compassionate or artistic mediums.",
    "neptune_square_pluto": "<b>The tension between the need for absolute power and control clashes violently with the dissolving, chaotic forces of illusion and collective empathy.</b><br><br>The native may struggle with intense psychological paranoia, obsessive power dynamics cloaked in spiritual manipulation, or the painful destruction of their deepest ideals.",
    "neptune_trine_pluto": "<b>The forces of profound psychological regeneration and transcendent spiritual imagination flow together in perfect harmony.</b><br><br>The native effortlessly accesses the deepest mysteries of the unconscious, yielding immense healing power and the ability to effortlessly transform collective suffering into profound spiritual insight.",
    "neptune_opposition_pluto": "<b>The individual experiences a profound, externalized battle between the forces of dark, manipulative power and the vulnerable, highly sensitized realms of spirit and illusion.</b><br><br>They are tasked with navigating immense collective shadows, requiring them to constantly purify their intentions to avoid being swallowed by psychic toxicity.",
    "neptune_quincunx_pluto": "<b>There is a persistent, underlying friction between the native's deep, transformative survival instincts and their highly sensitive, spiritual vulnerability.</b><br><br>They must continuously adjust their psychological boundaries, learning to wield their intensity without shattering their delicate connection to the divine.",
    "neptune_conjunction_chiron": "<b>The core wound of the individual is deeply intertwined with feelings of profound victimization, spiritual abandonment, or a shattered connection to the divine.</b><br><br>Healing comes only through absolute surrender and channeling their immense empathetic pain into universal compassion, making them a profoundly gifted, albeit highly sensitive, spiritual healer.",
    "neptune_sextile_chiron": "<b>The native's imagination and intuition act as a soothing, gentle balm for their deepest psychological wounds.</b><br><br>They possess a natural ability to use art, music, or spiritual practices to organically heal themselves and offer empathetic guidance to others in pain.",
    "neptune_square_chiron": "<b>A severe psychological friction exists between the native's core unhealable wound and their desperate, often destructive attempts to escape the pain through illusion or addiction.</b><br><br>They must confront the reality of their trauma directly, as spiritual bypassing or playing the martyr will only exacerbate their suffering.",
    "neptune_trine_chiron": "<b>The flow between the native's core wounds and their spiritual connectivity is incredibly harmonious, allowing trauma to be effortlessly transmuted into high art or divine wisdom.</b><br><br>They wear their scars with mystical grace, naturally serving as a beacon of profound, non-judgmental healing for the collective.",
    "neptune_opposition_chiron": "<b>The individual constantly projects their spiritual wounds onto others, either seeking a perfect savior to heal them or attempting to rescue completely broken people.</b><br><br>To find true healing, they must realize that the divine mirror they seek externally can only be found by establishing rigorous boundaries within themselves.",
    "neptune_quincunx_chiron": "<b>The native's attempts to heal themselves spiritually often feel slightly off-target, leading to a frustrating cycle of vague symptom management rather than root-cause resolution.</b><br><br>They must continually adjust their healing modalities, learning to integrate grounded psychological work with their ethereal spiritual practices.",
    "neptune_conjunction_north_node": "<b>The individual's karmic life path is inextricably linked to the development of compassion, artistic imagination, and spiritual surrender.</b><br><br>They are destined to dissolve rigid ego boundaries and embrace the collective unconscious, though they must guard against losing their direction in a sea of illusion.",
    "neptune_sextile_north_node": "<b>The native's spiritual, intuitive, and artistic talents gently support their evolutionary journey forward.</b><br><br>They encounter helpful, spiritually minded individuals and subtle synchronicities that smoothly guide them toward fulfilling their soul's highest purpose.",
    "neptune_square_north_node": "<b>The native faces a karmic crossroads where their tendency toward escapism, illusion, or victimhood actively distracts them from their true evolutionary path.</b><br><br>They must aggressively battle their own self-deception and the desire to remain in an unconscious fog in order to achieve their destiny.",
    "neptune_trine_north_node": "<b>The individual's karmic direction is beautifully aligned with their highest spiritual and imaginative potentials, creating an effortless flow toward their destiny.</b><br><br>Their innate compassion and visionary talents act as a natural compass, drawing them toward a life of profound spiritual or artistic fulfillment.",
    "neptune_opposition_north_node": "<b>This places Neptune conjunct the South Node, indicating a karmic history deeply saturated in mysticism, martyrdom, or escapism.</b><br><br>The native must consciously move away from relying on their comfortable, nebulous fantasies, learning to ground themselves in the practical reality demanded by their North Node.",
    "neptune_quincunx_north_node": "<b>The native's spiritual longings and intuitive hits feel awkwardly out of sync with the actual steps required to fulfill their karmic destiny.</b><br><br>They must continually make subtle adjustments, learning how to honor their imagination without letting it derail their forward evolutionary progress.",
    "neptune_conjunction_south_node": "<b>The native enters this life with an innate, almost overflowing mastery of spiritual, intuitive, or artistic realms from past karmic cycles.</b><br><br>However, this is a point of ultimate comfort and potential stagnation; they must resist the strong pull to dissolve into escapism, isolation, or chronic victimhood, and instead learn to practically apply these gifts.",
    "neptune_sextile_south_node": "<b>The native's intuitive and imaginative gifts from the past smoothly support their current psychological baseline, providing a reservoir of inner peace.</b><br><br>These talents are easily accessible but do not overwhelmingly distract the individual from moving forward on their karmic path.",
    "neptune_square_south_node": "<b>Deeply ingrained karmic patterns of illusion, addiction, or martyrdom create a continuous, frustrating tension that hinders the soul's evolution.</b><br><br>The native must consciously break these deeply entrenched, subconscious habits of escapism to resolve their karmic tension and move forward.",
    "neptune_trine_south_node": "<b>The native enjoys a seamless, highly integrated connection to their past-life spiritual wisdom and artistic mastery.</b><br><br>While these gifts flow effortlessly, the individual must ensure they actively use this spiritual foundation to propel themselves forward, rather than passively floating in their karmic comfort zone.",
    "neptune_opposition_south_node": "<b>This is identical to the Conjunction with the North Node; the native's spiritual and imaginative evolution is the primary goal of this lifetime.</b><br><br>They must actively cultivate the higher octaves of Neptune\u2014compassion, art, and divine connection\u2014leaving behind the rigid or overly pragmatic karmic traits of their past.",
    "neptune_quincunx_south_node": "<b>The native feels a subtle, irritating disconnect between their deeply ingrained spiritual habits and the actual reality of their current karmic situation.</b><br><br>They are forced to continually re-evaluate and adjust their subconscious coping mechanisms, learning to release outdated fantasies that no longer serve them.",
    "neptune_conjunction_ceres": "<b>The native's capacity for nurturing and maternal care is infinitely compassionate, boundlessly empathetic, and often highly idealized.</b><br><br>However, they may struggle with extreme codependency, confusing true nourishment with emotional enmeshment, or experiencing profound, mysterious grief related to the loss of a loved one.",
    "neptune_sextile_ceres": "<b>Nurturing and spiritual connection go hand-in-hand, allowing the native to provide incredibly soothing, intuitive care to those around them.</b><br><br>They find deep emotional replenishment through nature, artistic expression, and providing a safe, imaginative sanctuary for others.",
    "neptune_square_ceres": "<b>The individual's need to nurture or be nurtured conflicts sharply with their tendencies toward escapism, confusion, or lack of boundaries.</b><br><br>They may overextend themselves to the point of exhaustion playing the savior, or suffer from mysterious dietary and physical sensitivities tied to emotional distress.",
    "neptune_trine_ceres": "<b>The archetype of the Earth Mother blends seamlessly with the cosmic ocean, creating an individual who heals intuitively through unconditional love and spiritual nourishment.</b><br><br>They possess a magical ability to make others feel profoundly seen and emotionally held without draining their own energetic reserves.",
    "neptune_opposition_ceres": "<b>The native frequently encounters challenging dynamics where their desire to provide practical care is undermined by deception, misunderstanding, or the emotional unavailability of the receiver.</b><br><br>They must learn to establish firm emotional boundaries, realizing that they cannot spiritually save everyone they wish to nurture.",
    "neptune_quincunx_ceres": "<b>A subtle, persistent dissonance exists between the way the native gives care and the actual spiritual or emotional needs of those they are nurturing.</b><br><br>They must continually refine their approach, learning to offer support that is both practically grounding and spiritually sensitive without causing crossed wires.",
    "neptune_conjunction_pallas": "<b>The native's pattern recognition, strategic intellect, and creative intelligence are profoundly intuitive, non-linear, and deeply mystical.</b><br><br>They possess a genius for grasping abstract, symbolic concepts and excel in fields requiring artistic vision or subtle, psychological strategy, though they may lack practical, step-by-step logic.",
    "neptune_sextile_pallas": "<b>The individual effortlessly bridges the gap between structured, strategic thinking and fluid, imaginative intuition.</b><br><br>This harmonious aspect makes them brilliant mediators, visionary artists, and insightful problem-solvers who can clearly see the hidden, spiritual dimensions of complex issues.",
    "neptune_square_pallas": "<b>The native's logical strategy frequently clashes with their chaotic imagination, leading to poorly executed plans, mental confusion, or self-sabotage through over-idealization.</b><br><br>They must rigorously double-check their intellectual conclusions, as their brilliant intuition is often clouded by deceptive emotional biases.",
    "neptune_trine_pallas": "<b>Strategic intelligence and spiritual vision operate as a unified, master-level force, granting the native an almost prophetic ability to see future patterns.</b><br><br>They are highly gifted at maneuvering through complex situations using subtle, empathetic wisdom and effortless creative problem-solving.",
    "neptune_opposition_pallas": "<b>The native's strategic planning is frequently opposed by external illusions, deceptive people, or unpredictable spiritual variables that shatter their logical frameworks.</b><br><br>They must learn to remain highly adaptable, integrating the chaotic, boundary-dissolving nature of reality into their otherwise structured mental paradigms.",
    "neptune_quincunx_pallas": "<b>The individual's intuitive insights and their logical strategies require constant, awkward recalibration to function together.</b><br><br>They often feel that their brilliant, imaginative ideas are fundamentally incompatible with the practical steps required to execute them, demanding immense intellectual patience.",
    "neptune_conjunction_juno": "<b>The native's approach to commitment and partnership is intensely romanticized, seeking a profound, ultimate spiritual union or a soulmate connection.</b><br><br>While capable of incredible devotion, they are highly susceptible to ignoring a partner's toxic traits, entering codependent marriages, or falling in love with the potential of a person rather than reality.",
    "neptune_sextile_juno": "<b>Opportunities for committed partnerships are gently supported by shared spiritual values, mutual empathy, and a highly romantic, aesthetic connection.</b><br><br>The native naturally attracts relationships that offer both loyalty and a soothing, imaginative sanctuary from the harshness of the world.",
    "neptune_square_juno": "<b>A painful friction exists between the native's practical need for commitment and their overwhelming, unrealistic fantasies regarding marriage.</b><br><br>This aspect often manifests as profound disillusionment in partnerships, attracting deceptive spouses, or constantly feeling trapped by the mundane realities of a long-term union.",
    "neptune_trine_juno": "<b>The individual's marriages and deepest commitments are blessed with an effortless flow of profound spiritual harmony and unconditional love.</b><br><br>They naturally establish a deeply psychic, empathetic bond with their partners, elevating the relationship into a true divine partnership.",
    "neptune_opposition_juno": "<b>The native frequently projects their ultimate spiritual ideals onto their partners, eventually leading to a crisis when the human flaws of the spouse inevitably shatter the illusion.</b><br><br>They must fiercely combat the savior/victim dynamic in relationships, learning that true commitment requires clear boundaries and absolute honesty.",
    "neptune_quincunx_juno": "<b>The individual's need for a dedicated partnership is continuously irritated by vague, unfulfilled spiritual or romantic longings that make them question their commitments.</b><br><br>They must constantly adjust their expectations, learning to infuse mundane relationship duties with spiritual meaning to avoid chronic dissatisfaction.",
    "neptune_conjunction_vesta": "<b>The native's capacity for focus and devotion is entirely spiritualized, capable of channeling intense, laser-like energy into mystical, artistic, or healing practices.</b><br><br>Their highest service to themselves is found in retreat and meditation, though they run the risk of becoming overly fanatical or entirely losing their identity to a spiritual cause.",
    "neptune_sextile_vesta": "<b>The individual's dedication to their work or spiritual practice is smoothly supported by their vast imagination and empathetic intuition.</b><br><br>They find it incredibly easy to maintain a dedicated, sacred focus in their daily routines, naturally infusing their mundane tasks with a sense of divine purpose.",
    "neptune_square_vesta": "<b>The native's need for dedicated focus is constantly derailed by daydreaming, confusion, escapism, or a lack of boundaries.</b><br><br>They struggle immensely to maintain a consistent spiritual or work practice, often feeling that their sacred devotion is fundamentally incompatible with the chaotic demands of their imagination.",
    "neptune_trine_vesta": "<b>Sacred focus and spiritual vision flow together perfectly, allowing the native to achieve states of profound meditative absorption and brilliant artistic flow.</b><br><br>They possess an effortless, pure dedication to their highest ideals, turning their entire life into a living, breathing spiritual practice.",
    "neptune_opposition_vesta": "<b>The individual experiences a deep conflict between their intense need for solitary devotion and the boundary-dissolving, chaotic demands of the external collective.</b><br><br>They must carefully navigate the tension between maintaining their sacred internal fire and being overwhelmed by the psychic noise of the world.",
    "neptune_quincunx_vesta": "<b>A persistent, subtle dissonance exists between the native's desire to focus and the highly fluid, erratic nature of their spiritual inspirations.</b><br><br>They must constantly tweak their rituals and workspaces, learning to accommodate their hypersensitivity without entirely losing their concentration.",
    "neptune_conjunction_ascendant": "<b>The individual's physical appearance and outward persona are profoundly magnetic, ethereal, and highly permeable to the environment.</b><br><br>They project a glamorous, mysterious, or highly empathetic image, but they frequently struggle with an undefined sense of self, easily absorbing the projections and psychic debris of everyone they meet.",
    "neptune_sextile_ascendant": "<b>The native's outer personality is naturally graced with a gentle, compassionate, and highly imaginative aura that easily charms others.</b><br><br>They possess a fluid, adaptable social grace, allowing them to express their spiritual depth in a way that is highly appealing and easily understood by the public.",
    "neptune_square_ascendant": "<b>A continuous tension exists between the native's true identity and the highly idealized, confusing, or deceptive mask they present to the world.</b><br><br>They may suffer from profound misunderstandings with others, projecting an image that is vastly different from their core reality, or struggling with mysterious physical sensitivities.",
    "neptune_trine_ascendant": "<b>The individual's spiritual essence and their physical persona operate in beautiful harmony, creating an aura of effortless mystical magnetism.</b><br><br>They naturally embody their highest, most compassionate ideals, easily drawing people toward their healing presence and artistic charm.",
    "neptune_opposition_ascendant": "<b>This places Neptune on the Descendant, meaning the native constantly seeks their own spiritual identity through the mirror of other people.</b><br><br>They possess an immense capacity for empathetic connection but are highly prone to losing themselves in relationships, attracting partners who require saving or who deceive them.",
    "neptune_quincunx_ascendant": "<b>The native's physical presentation and immediate reactions require constant, awkward adjustments to align with their deep, subtle spiritual nature.</b><br><br>They often feel misunderstood in first impressions, projecting an energy that feels slightly out of sync with their true, highly sensitive inner reality.",
    "neptune_conjunction_descendant": "<b>The native's experience of partnership is highly romanticized, seeking a literal soulmate to provide spiritual salvation.</b><br><br>They are immensely empathetic in one-on-one connections but are acutely vulnerable to codependency, deception, and the relentless pattern of attracting victims or adopting the savior role in relationships.",
    "neptune_sextile_descendant": "<b>Opportunities for partnership are gently supported by shared spiritual values and a mutual, compassionate understanding.</b><br><br>The native naturally fosters harmonious, forgiving relationships, easily attracting individuals who appreciate their imaginative depth and empathetic nature.",
    "neptune_square_descendant": "<b>The native experiences a frustrating conflict between their desire for a solid partnership and their tendency to view relationships through a highly distorted, idealistic lens.</b><br><br>This friction often results in profound relational disillusionment, boundary violations, and a struggle to see partners objectively.",
    "neptune_trine_descendant": "<b>The individual's approach to relationships is effortlessly infused with unconditional love, profound spiritual harmony, and deep psychic connectivity.</b><br><br>They naturally attract highly evolved, empathetic partners, creating unions that serve as beautiful sanctuaries of mutual artistic or spiritual inspiration.",
    "neptune_opposition_descendant": "<b>With Neptune on the Ascendant, the native's highly porous, sensitive identity often overwhelms their ability to maintain clear boundaries in partnerships.</b><br><br>They must consciously work to solidify their own sense of self, ensuring they do not dissolve completely into the needs and projections of their significant others.",
    "neptune_quincunx_descendant": "<b>The native's need for relationship requires continuous, uncomfortable adjustments to accommodate their vague, fluctuating spiritual ideals.</b><br><br>They often experience a subtle, chronic dissatisfaction in partnerships, struggling to blend their desire for a spiritual union with the practical realities of interpersonal dynamics.",
    "neptune_conjunction_mc": "<b>The individual's public image, career, and life direction are deeply intertwined with spirituality, the arts, healing, or the collective imagination.</b><br><br>They may achieve a glamorous, highly idealized public status, but they must fiercely guard against career scandals, a lack of clear direction, and the burden of carrying the public's projections.",
    "neptune_sextile_mc": "<b>The native's professional goals are smoothly supported by their intuition, imagination, and a naturally compassionate public demeanor.</b><br><br>They easily integrate their spiritual values into their career path, attracting favorable opportunities in fields related to art, psychology, or humanitarian service.",
    "neptune_square_mc": "<b>A profound tension exists between the native's worldly ambitions and their powerful, often chaotic spiritual or escapist tendencies.</b><br><br>They may struggle severely with career direction, facing periods of professional disillusionment, public misunderstandings, or the urge to abandon their responsibilities entirely for a life of fantasy.",
    "neptune_trine_mc": "<b>The native's career path and public reputation flow beautifully with their highest spiritual ideals, granting them an almost magical ability to achieve their goals.</b><br><br>They are naturally viewed as inspiring, visionary leaders in their field, effortlessly manifesting their imaginative talents into worldly success.",
    "neptune_opposition_mc": "<b>This places Neptune on the IC, indicating that the native's career ambitions are frequently subverted or deeply influenced by complex, hidden dynamics from their family or childhood.</b><br><br>Their true life purpose is often found in retreating from the public eye to explore their profound, private spiritual depths.",
    "neptune_quincunx_mc": "<b>The native's professional aspirations and their subtle, spiritual sensitivities are in a constant state of awkward friction.</b><br><br>They must continually adjust their career trajectory, learning how to honor their need for creative or spiritual expression without sabotaging their practical public standing.",
    "neptune_conjunction_ic": "<b>The foundational roots, family history, and private psychological world of the native are deeply saturated in mysticism, secrets, or emotional porosity.</b><br><br>While they possess an incredibly rich, psychic inner life, they may struggle with a profound sense of rootlessness, ancestral trauma, or a heavily idealized view of their childhood.",
    "neptune_sextile_ic": "<b>The native's home life and psychological foundations are gently supported by a deep, intuitive understanding of emotional security.</b><br><br>They naturally create a highly spiritual, imaginative, and soothing domestic environment that serves as a perfect sanctuary from the outside world.",
    "neptune_square_ic": "<b>The individual experiences a persistent internal friction between their need for foundational security and a chaotic, dissolving energy within their family or private life.</b><br><br>This can manifest as highly confusing childhood experiences, emotional boundary issues with parents, and a lifelong struggle to feel internally grounded.",
    "neptune_trine_ic": "<b>The native's deepest psychological foundations are harmoniously aligned with the spiritual realm, providing an immense, unshakable reservoir of inner peace.</b><br><br>They possess a profound, effortless connection to their ancestry and find ultimate emotional replenishment through their rich, imaginative inner world.",
    "neptune_opposition_ic": "<b>With Neptune on the MC, the native's private life and sense of home are frequently disrupted by their highly public, glamorous, or chaotic career path.</b><br><br>They must work diligently to create clear boundaries between their idealized public persona and their highly sensitive, vulnerable private self.",
    "neptune_quincunx_ic": "<b>The native feels a subtle, continuous disconnect between their private emotional needs and their vague, shifting spiritual ideals.</b><br><br>They must constantly refine their concept of home and security, learning to create a private foundation that honors their hypersensitivity without leaving them feeling unanchored.",
    "neptune_conjunction_fortune": "<b>The individual's greatest source of joy, fulfillment, and &quot;luck&quot; is inextricably tied to spiritual surrender, artistic expression, and boundless compassion.</b><br><br>They achieve ultimate success when they release the need for strict control, allowing their profound intuition and imagination to guide their path.",
    "neptune_sextile_fortune": "<b>The native's imaginative and intuitive faculties smoothly support their pursuit of happiness and personal fulfillment.</b><br><br>They naturally encounter serendipitous opportunities when they engage in artistic, healing, or spiritually oriented activities that uplift others.",
    "neptune_square_fortune": "<b>A frustrating tension exists between the native's desire for joy and their tendencies toward escapism, self-deception, or playing the victim.</b><br><br>They often block their own success by chasing unrealistic fantasies, requiring them to ground their ideals in reality to experience true fulfillment.",
    "neptune_trine_fortune": "<b>The flow between the native's spiritual connection and their personal joy is incredibly harmonious, creating a life rich with serendipity and magical synchronicity.</b><br><br>They effortlessly attract abundance and happiness by simply resting in their highest, most compassionate, and visionary nature.",
    "neptune_opposition_fortune": "<b>The native frequently projects their ultimate source of happiness onto external spiritual ideals, elusive dreams, or other people, leading to inevitable disillusionment.</b><br><br>They must learn that true joy is an internal state, requiring them to stop chasing external illusions and start cultivating healthy internal boundaries.",
    "neptune_quincunx_fortune": "<b>The individual's pursuit of fulfillment requires continuous, awkward adjustments to accommodate their highly sensitive, spiritual nature.</b><br><br>They often feel a subtle dissatisfaction when achieving their worldly goals, requiring them to continually refine how they integrate their soul's vision with their earthly joy.",
    "neptune_conjunction_lilith": "<b>The deepest, most repressed shadows of the psyche merge with the dissolving, chaotic waters of the collective unconscious.</b><br><br>This native possesses immense, almost dangerous psychic and seductive power, but must fiercely guard against dark escapism, extreme spiritual manipulation, or losing their mind to occult obsessions.",
    "neptune_sextile_lilith": "<b>The native's spiritual and imaginative talents naturally provide a healthy, creative outlet for their repressed shadows and primal urges.</b><br><br>They easily integrate their taboo desires into artistic or spiritual practices, rendering their dark side highly magnetic and surprisingly healing.",
    "neptune_square_lilith": "<b>A severe psychological friction exists between the native's idealized spiritual image and their deeply repressed, taboo, or rageful inner shadows.</b><br><br>This tension can lead to highly destructive escapism, spiritual hypocrisy, or a tendency to attract intensely deceptive and manipulative sexual partners.",
    "neptune_trine_lilith": "<b>The native's primal, untamed feminine power and their profound spiritual intuition operate in effortless, masterful harmony.</b><br><br>They are natural shamans, easily navigating the darkest, most taboo realms of the human psyche with immense compassion, grace, and transformative artistic vision.",
    "neptune_opposition_lilith": "<b>The individual experiences a profound polarization between their conscious spiritual ideals and the dark, repressed shadows they constantly encounter in the external world.</b><br><br>They frequently project their own taboo desires onto others, encountering deceptive or highly manipulative individuals until they integrate their own inner darkness.",
    "neptune_quincunx_lilith": "<b>The native feels a persistent, uncomfortable dissonance between their subtle spiritual sensitivities and the raw, demanding nature of their repressed primal instincts.</b><br><br>They must continuously navigate a psychological tightrope, learning to acknowledge their taboo desires without allowing them to poison their higher spiritual ideals.",
    "pluto_conjunction_sun": "<b>Pluto Conjunction Sun:</b> Your deepest power, transformation, and primal intensity merges powerfully with your core identity and vital energy. This creates a fused, intense dynamic where these two areas of your life cannot operate independently.",
    "pluto_sextile_sun": "<b>Pluto Sextile Sun:</b> Your deepest power, transformation, and primal intensity harmonizes with your core identity and vital energy. This creates a supportive flow that encourages these two areas of your life.",
    "pluto_square_sun": "<b>Pluto Square Sun:</b> Your deepest power, transformation, and primal intensity creates tension and friction with your core identity and vital energy. This creates a challenging but highly motivating dynamic that demands action and resolution between these two areas of your life.",
    "pluto_trine_sun": "<b>Pluto Trine Sun:</b> Your deepest power, transformation, and primal intensity flows effortlessly with your core identity and vital energy. This creates a natural talent and ease between these two areas of your life, though it can sometimes lead to complacency.",
    "pluto_opposition_sun": "<b>Pluto Opposition Sun:</b> Your deepest power, transformation, and primal intensity is polarized against your core identity and vital energy. This creates a tug-of-war dynamic where you must learn to balance and integrate these two competing areas of your life.",
    "pluto_quincunx_sun": "<b>Pluto Quincunx Sun:</b> Your deepest power, transformation, and primal intensity is awkwardly misaligned with your core identity and vital energy. This creates a need for constant adjustment and compromise between these two areas of your life.",
